stateDiagram-v2
    state "下一步" as next
    state "进行中" as doing
    state "等待中" as waiting
    state "受阻" as blocked
    state "已完成" as done

    [*] --> next: 创建
    next --> doing: 开始
    doing --> waiting: 等待外部
    doing --> blocked: 遇到阻塞（填原因）
    waiting --> doing: 恢复
    blocked --> doing: 解除
    doing --> done: 完成（记录 completedAt）
    waiting --> done: 直接完成
    done --> doing: 重新打开
    done --> [*]: 归档
